  "text": "\r\n\t\t Elections & Town Meeting | Bow, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business in Bow   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk & Tax Collector \nElections & Town Meeting \r\nElections & Town Meeting\t\t \r\n2026 Election Dates and Information \nState General Election Sample Ballot  \nState General election- November 3, 2026 \nLocation - Bow Memorial School, 20 Bow Center Road, Bow, NH 03304 \nElection Time - 7:00 a.m. to 7 p.m. \nLast day to register to vote before the State General Election is  \nby 8:30 am on Friday October 23, 2026. \nUnregistered voters may register to vote at the polls on election day \n2026 Town and School Meeting Information \nAs we receive information, we will update this page, please check periodically for updated information. \nTown Manager's Proposed FY 2026-27   \n2026 Town of Bow Town Warrant \n2026-27 Preliminary Town Budget \n2026 MS-737 signed by the Budget Committee and Budget \nCandidates Running for Town Elected Positions \n2026 Town Zoning Amendments \nTown Meeting \nDeliberative session for Town budget and special warrant articles Wednesday,  March 11, 2026, 6:30 p.m. , Snow dates (TBD), at Bow High School, 55 Falcon Way. \nLink to watch the Town Meeting   \n2026 Town Meeting Minutes \nA NOTE ABOUT THE BOW SCHOOL DISTRICT MEETING \nThe 2026 Annual School District meeting will be on March 13, 2026, at 6:00 p.m. at the Bow High School Auditorium via in person. The Backup date for the School District meeting is (TBD). For information on the annual school district meeting and voting on the school district budget, please  visit the SAU 67 website . \nPreliminary Bow School District Budget and Warrant \nAnnual Report  \nThe 2025 Annual Report will be at the Municipal Building, Baker Free Library, and Community Building once it has been printed.  Copies will also be available at Ballot Voting/Elections and Town Meeting, and a digital version will be posted online in the  Archive Center . \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk & Tax Collector Department \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 10 Grandview Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Bow ,  NH   03304 \r\nPhone:  603-223-3980 \r\nFax: 603-225-5428 \r\nHours:  Monday - Friday, 7:30 a.m. - 4:00 p.m., (excluding  Town Holidays ) \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMridula Naik\r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail  \r\nPhone: 603-223-3980 Office, 603-223-3981 Direct \r\n\t\t\t\t\tKate Ess\r\nSupervisor of the Checklist \r\nEmail  \r\nPhone:  603-223-3980 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tBeth Titus\r\nSupervisor of the Checklist \r\nEmail  \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\tAmy  Knepper\r\nSupervisor of the Checklist \r\nEmail  \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t How to Change a Party \r\n\t\t\t How to Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t  Supervisors of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t Vote by Absentee Ballot \r\n\t\t\t Voting Machine \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Permitting \r\n\t\t\t Elections and Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n\t\t\t GIS & Tax Maps \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Bow \n10 Grandview Road \nBow, NH 03304 \nPhone:  603-223-3900 \nStaff Directory \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Baker Free Library \n         Bow Schools \n         Employment Opportunities \n         Motor Vehicle Registration \n         Parks and Recreation \n         Send Us Comments \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Site Map \n         Mission \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Powered by CivicPlus® \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
